Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:05:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ci): restaurar .gitignore original de main (revierte
 eliminacion destructiva del PR #53)

El PR #53 reemplazo las 6 lineas de proteccion (node_modules/, dist/, *.tsbuildinfo, playwright-report/, test-results/, .env) por solo *.tar.gz, causando el fallo del hard gate 'QA dependency audit' en el run 40334765495. Se restaura el blob exacto de main (4a3b9d5).
---
 .gitignore | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index 335ec95..4a3b9d5 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -1 +1,6 @@
-*.tar.gz
+node_modules/
+dist/
+*.tsbuildinfo
+playwright-report/
+test-results/
+.env
-- 
2.39.5

